| SetDDE — point the Acorn C/C++ toolchain variables at the DDE on the
| hostfs disc, without the desktop-only parts of !SetPaths.
| Note rpcemu's HostFS name mapping: the Windows directory AcornC.C++
| is seen by RISC OS as AcornC/C++ (first dot becomes a slash).
Set SetPaths$Dir HostFS::HostFS.$.AcornC/C++.!SetPaths
/<SetPaths$Dir>.SetLibPath <SetPaths$Dir>.Lib32.
Set C/C++$Dir <SetPaths$Dir>.^
Set APCS APCS-32
Set APCSExport$Dir <C/C++$Dir>.Export.<APCS>
Set CExport$Dir <APCSExport$Dir>.C
Set Lib$Dir <APCSExport$Dir>.Lib
Set Hdr$Dir <APCSExport$Dir>.Hdr
Set CLIB$Path <Lib$Dir>.clib.
Set C$Path <CLIB$Path>,<Lib$Dir>.
Set C$LibRoot C:
